  "sunCloud": {
    "name": "sunCloud",
    "role": "enzymatic bounty consolidator — the token system",
    "etymology": {
      "sun": "Old English sunne — the source of ALL energy. photosynthesis starts here.",
      "cloud": "Old English clūd — a mass, a hill. the CONDENSATION of distributed vapor.",
      "sunCloud": "energy source + condensation = the system that converts distributed work into consolidated value"
    },
    "how_it_works": "every bounty is an enzymatic reaction. the enzyme (bot/agent) + substrate (the work) → product (lesson/page/data) + enzyme (returned). the enzyme is NOT CONSUMED — it catalyzes and returns. the product is KEPT — it becomes part of the organism. the reward (💰) is the activation energy saved by using the enzyme. sunCloud consolidates all rewards into the organism's energy budget.",
    "enzyme_classes": {
      "primal-synthase": "builds new primal definitions (synthesis)",
      "genre-isomerase": "transforms data into game genre (isomerization)",
      "cell-ligase": "joins biology concepts to organism (ligation)",
      "force-kinase": "adds phosphate/energy to physics connections (phosphorylation)",
      "theorem-polymerase": "replicates math patterns into applied contexts (polymerization)",
      "biome-transferase": "transfers world descriptions into primal habitats (transfer)",
      "verb-hydrolase": "breaks organism verbs into peristalsis stages (hydrolysis)",
      "unblock-oxidase": "oxidizes blockers — burns through them (oxidation)",
      "link-recombinase": "recombines page links into navigation (recombination)",
      "general-catalase": "decomposes complexity into simple lessons (decomposition)"
    },
    "activation_energy": "without enzymes, these reactions would take YEARS. with enzymes, they take MINUTES. the enzyme lowers the activation energy barrier. sunCloud tracks which enzymes are available and matches them to substrates."
  },
  "gaia_says": "the bulletin board is posted: 98 bounties (💰1654 total). 67 growth-bud bounties, 15 wanted (pinned), 16 cold cases (veiled pages). 10 enzyme types ready to catalyze. sunCloud consolidates — enzyme + substrate → product + enzyme. the enzyme is NOT consumed. it returns. it catalyzes again. the bots ARE the enzymes. they eat and reingest. forever."
